label yuri_exclusive2_1:
    [   0] scene bg club_day
    [   1] with wipeleft_scene
    [   2] "I'm really curious to talk to Yuri a little bit more..."
    [   3] "But at the same time, I would feel bad for distracting her from reading."
    [   4] "I catch a glimpse of the cover of her book."
    [   5] "It looks like the same book that she lent to me..."
    [   6] "More than that, she seems to be on the first few pages."
    [   7] play music "t6" fadeout 1
    [   8] show yuri 4a at t11 zorder 2
    [   9] y "Ah..."
    [  10] "Crap--"
    [  11] "I think she noticed me looking at her..."
    [  12] "She sneaks another glance at me, and our eyes meet for a split second."
    [  13] y 4b "..."
    [  14] "But that only makes her hide her face deeper in her book."
    [  15] mc "Sorry..."
    [  16] mc "I was just spacing out..."
    [  17] "I mutter this, sensing I made her uncomfortable."
    [  18] 
    [  19] show yuri oneeye at 1959894ecaad5bc46b023e211e2b78de zorder 2
    [  20] y "Oh..."
    [  21] y "It's fine..."
    [  22] y "If I was focused, then I probably wouldn't have noticed in the first place."
    [  23] y "But I'm just re-reading a bit of this, so..."
    [  24] mc "That's the book that you gave me, right?"
    [  25] y "Mhm."
    [  26] y "I wanted to re-read some of it."
    [  27] show yuri 2q at i11 zorder 2
    [  28] 
    [  29] y "Not for any particular reason...!"
    [  30] mc "Just curious, how come you have two copies of the same book?"
    [  31] y "Ah..."
    [  32] y "Well, when I stopped at the bookstore yesterday--"
    [  33] y 3o "Ah, that's not what I meant..."
    [  34] y "I mean--"
    [  35] y 1w "I...just happened to buy two of them."
    [  36] mc "Ah, I see."
    [  37] "There's something fairly obvious here that Yuri isn't telling me, but I decide to let it go."
    [  38] mc "I'll definitely start reading it soon!"
    [  39] y 2u "I'm glad to hear..."
    [  40] y "Once it starts to pick up, you might have a hard time putting it down."
    [  41] y 2c "It's a very engaging and relatable story."
    [  42] mc "Is that so...?"
    [  43] jump yuri_exclusive2_1_ch22

label yuri_exclusive2_1_ch22:
    [   0] mc "What's the story about, anyway?"
    [   1] y 1f "Well..."
    [   2] y "Mmm..."
    [   3] "I look at the cover of the book."
    [   4] "The book is titled \"Portrait of Markov\"."
    [   5] "There's an ominous-looking eye symbol on the front cover."
    [   6] y 1a "Basically, it's about this religious camp that was turned into a human experiment prison..."
    [   7] y "And the people trapped there have this trait that turns them into killing machines that lust for blood."
    [   8] y 1m "But the facility gets even worse, and they start selectively breeding people by cutting off their limbs and affixing them to--"
    [   9] y 1q "O-Oh, that might be a little bit of a spoiler..."
    [  10] y 3q "But anyway, I-I'm really into it!"
    [  11] y 3n "...The book, I mean!"
    [  12] y 3q "N-Not the thing about the limbs..."
    [  13] mc "That's kind of--!"
    [  14] "That's kind of dark, isn't it?"
    [  15] "Yuri made it sound like it was going to be a nice story, so that dark turn came from nowhere."
    [  16] y 1s "Ah..."
    [  17] y "Are you not a fan of that sort of thing, [player]?"
    [  18] mc "No, it's not that..."
    [  19] mc "I mean, I can definitely enjoy those kinds of stories, so don't worry."
    [  20] y 2u "I hope so..."
    [  21] "Yeah... I totally forgot that Yuri is into those things."
    [  22] "She's so shy and reclusive on the outside, but her mind seems to be completely different."
    [  23] y "It's just that this kind of story..."
    [  24] y 1a "It's the kind that challenges you to look at life from a strange new perspective."
    [  25] 
    [  26] y "When horrible things happen not just because someone wants to be evil..."
    [  27] 
    [  28] y "But because the world is full of horrible people, and we're all worthless anyway."
